The root cause is now concrete: the sandbox reports namespace PIDs from `getpid()` while mounting `/proc` from the parent namespace. Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, so it looks up a nonexistent numeric PID. I’m applying a narrow audit-only preload shim that makes this lookup use the outer PID exposed by `/proc/self`; the preflight logic and inputs remain untouched, and I’ll preserve the shim source and diagnostics as evidence.
