+PYTHONPATH=/reference python3 /audit-output/evidence/run_preflight.py
+```
+
+Results: `preflight-rerun-success.log`, `preflight-rerun.json`, and
+`preflight-build-full.log` (exit 0). The exact caller is
+`run_preflight.py`.
