+Useful boundary and counterfactual witnesses include `n = -1` for the negative
+branch, `n = 0` for the zero-iteration path, and `I = N = 1` for the inclusive
+loop boundary. Changing `""`, the initial `"0"`/`1`, `<=`, the appended index,
